      "description": "Consecutive calendar weeks (Monday start, same as **This week vs corridor**) with at least one logged activity. Counting starts from the **last week that contains any activity** when **this week is still empty** — so you see how long your run was without forcing **0** before you train. **Orange**: current week already has an activity (live streak). **Grey**: current week has no activity yet (same number = run ending at your last active week; logging this week turns orange).",
