        "content": "### 🏃 Fitness (CTL) - Long Term (42 days)\n*   **0-40:** Low / Beginner\n*   **40-70:** Intermediate / Regular\n*   **70-110:** Advanced / High Volume\n*   **110+:** Elite / Professional\n*   **Ramp Rate:** Aim for +3 to +6 points per week. >10 is the \"Danger Zone\".\n\n### ⚖️ Form (TSB) - Freshness (CTL - ATL)\n*   **+5 to +25:** **Fresh (Peak Zone)** - Ideal for racing/hard efforts.\n*   **-10 to +5:** **Neutral** - Maintenance/Transition.\n*   **-10 to -30:** **Productive Overload** - Optimal training zone.\n*   **Below -30:** **Danger Zone** - High risk of injury/burnout.\n\n### 🔋 Fatigue (ATL) - Short Term (7 days)\nRepresents your current tiredness. Should be higher than CTL during build phases and lower during recovery/tapering.",
